      "RelatedPartyDetails": "The Australian National Capital Artists Incorporated's constitution requires the Board of Management to include four current tenants. During the year there were a total of 8 board member tenants who rotated through the Board with a total rental income to the Association from related parties of $33,352. Board members were paid a total of $75 for works that the Association sold on their behalf and none were paid for any minor services rendered to the association whilst they were board members. Transactions between parties are on normal commercial terms and on conditions no more favourable than those available to other parties unless otherwise stated.",
